        ],
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><div class=\"page-kicker\">第1問 · 大問別問題</div><h2>第1問</h2><p class=\"prose\">関数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle f(x)=\\frac{x^3}{2x^2-1}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle f(x)=\\frac{x^3}{2x^2-1}</span> について、次の問い（問1〜4）に答えよ。</p><h3>問1</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)</span> は </p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ア}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ア}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}</span> のとき極大値 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle -\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{エ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{オ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle -\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{エ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{オ}}}</span> を、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle x=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{カ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{キ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle x=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{カ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{キ}}}</span> のとき極小値 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle \\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ク}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ケ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{コ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle \\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ク}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ケ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{コ}}}</span> をとる。</div></div></div><h3>問2</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=f(x)</span> のグラフは変曲点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(\\boxed{\\text{サ}},\\ \\boxed{\\text{シ}})\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(\\boxed{\\text{サ}},\\ \\boxed{\\text{シ}})</span> をもつ。</p><h3>問3</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\{f(x)-(ax+b)\\}=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\{f(x)-(ax+b)\\}=0</span> のとき、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle a=\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ス}}}{\\boxed{\\text{セ}}},\\ b=\\boxed{\\text{ソ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle a=\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{ス}}}{\\boxed{\\text{セ}}},\\ b=\\boxed{\\text{ソ}}</span> である。</p><h3>問4</h3><p class=\"prose\">方程式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x^3-2kx^2+k=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x^3-2kx^2+k=0</span> の異なる実数解の個数は、</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--cases\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle -\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{タ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}}&lt;k&lt;\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{テ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle -\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{タ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}}&lt;k&lt;\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{テ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}}</span> のとき <span class=\"answer-slot\">ニ</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle k=-\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{タ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}},\\ \\frac{\\boxed{\\text{テ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle k=-\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{タ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}},\\ \\frac{\\boxed{\\text{テ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}}</span> のとき <span class=\"answer-slot\">ヌ</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\displaystyle k&lt;-\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{タ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}},\\ \\frac{\\boxed{\\text{テ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}}&lt;k\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\displaystyle k&lt;-\\frac{\\boxed{\\text{タ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{チ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}},\\ \\frac{\\boxed{\\text{テ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ト}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ナ}}}&lt;k</span> のとき <span class=\"answer-slot\">ネ</span> である。</div></div></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "第2問",
        "order": 2,
        "sourcePageIds": [
